Audacity 2.4.2 runtime: licence and corresponding source

audacity-runtime-2.4.2.tar.gz in this directory redistributes files of the
Ubuntu 22.04 (Jammy) binary packages audacity 2.4.2~dfsg0-5 (amd64) and
audacity-data 2.4.2~dfsg0-5 (all), re-rooted as bin/, lib/audacity/ and
share/: the audacity executable, the mod-script-pipe module,
EQDefaultCurves.xml, the Nyquist runtime and plug-ins, and the package's
copyright and changelog files (91 archive entries; the archive retains upstream notices). The files are unmodified. solve.sh, at installation,
changes one string in lib/audacity/modules/mod-script-pipe.so: the FIFO path
template "/tmp/audacity_script_pipe.%s.%d" becomes the relative
"audacity_script_pipe.%s.%d" (NUL padded), so that the pipes follow
PBP_AUDIO_PIPE_DIR. SOURCE.json records the stock and patched digests.

